## Formatting Guidelines

### Color Scheme

- **Success**: `[green]✓[/green]`
- **Error**: `[red]✗[/red]`
- **Warning**: `[yellow]⚠[/yellow]`
- **Info**: `[cyan]ℹ[/cyan]`
- **Bold**: `[bold]Text[/bold]`

### Output Style

```python
# Title
console.print(f"\n[bold cyan]User Information[/bold cyan]")

# Key-Value pairs
console.print(f"[bold]Key:[/bold] value")

# Messages
console.print(f"[green]✓[/green] Success message")
```

### Table Style

```python
table = Table(
    title="Table Title",
    show_header=True,
    header_style="bold magenta"
)
table.add_column("Column 1", style="cyan")
table.add_column("Column 2", style="green", overflow="fold")
```

